WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:04.620
Even though it's been a decade since the original
Zombieland, the wild ride across the country

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:05.620
is far from over.

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:09.670
For devoted fans who've been waiting for years
and for anyone just now discovering the first

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:13.160
film, let’s look at everything we know about
Zombieland 2: Double Tap.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:18.300
This horror comedy sequel is currently scheduled
to come out on October 18, 2019.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.480
That makes perfect sense, as that will be
just thirteen days before Halloween.

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:24.340
And there's another good reason for that particular
release date.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:29.500
The first Zombieland crawled into theaters
on October 9, 2009, so the sequel is poised

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.460
to come out right around the one-decade anniversary.

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:35.499
That should be an ideal time to check out
where the four survivors landed after so many

00:00:35.499 --> 00:00:39.070
years on the road as a highly dysfunctional
zombie-busting family.

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:43.440
Originally, October 11 was pegged as the release
date, but it was pushed back a week, where

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:45.960
it will open against Maleficent: Mistress
of Evil.

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:49.780
If Columbus and Tallahassee can defeat the
undead, we're pretty sure they'll be able

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:51.900
to hold their own against Angelina Jolie as
well.

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:57.749
Emma Stone, Abigail Breslin, Woody Harrelson,
and Jesse Eisenberg are all set to reprise

00:00:57.749 --> 00:01:01.289
their roles, which means that our four heroes
stuck to their survival rules and made it

00:01:01.289 --> 00:01:02.890
through the last decade in one piece.

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:06.710
And Bill Murray is even reportedly coming
back, which doesn't make a lick of sense,

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:11.590
as he, spoiler alert, met his unfortunate
and hilarious demise in the first movie.

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:12.220
"W-w-wait.

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:13.220
Who's Bill Murray?"

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:15.320
"Now I've never hit a kid before.

00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:19.040
I mean, that's like asking who Gandhi is."

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:20.580
"Who's Gandhi?"

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:25.160
But that lapse in logic will be worth it,
as Murray is also bringing along his Ghostbusters

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:26.000
buddy, Dan Aykroyd.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.460
And that's not the only new addition!

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:32.590
Avan Jogia will be playing Berkeley, a bad
boy musician, and Zoey Deutch and Rosario

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:37.070
Dawson show up as a couple of characters named
Madison and Nevada, respectively.

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:40.900
And finally, Luke Wilson and Thomas Middleditch
will also be joining in on the fun.

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:44.860
With all that talent assembled, we're expecting
a thoroughly entertaining sequel!

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:49.619
Plot details for Zombieland 2 have thus far
been kept under wraps, but we do know that

00:01:49.619 --> 00:01:53.429
it takes place ten years after the original,
and that the zombies are way more dangerous

00:01:53.429 --> 00:01:54.040
than before.

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:57.740
According to The Hollywood Reporter, the sequel
will send the main quartet "from the White

00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:01.560
House to the American heartland as they face
off against new kinds of zombies that have

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:05.030
evolved since the first Zombieland, as well
as some new human survivors."

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:08.180
But perhaps toughest of all, they will also
have to "face the growing pains of their snarky,

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:09.040
makeshift family."

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:11.610
It's clear that everyone involved is excited
for part two.

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:15.410
But when it comes to quality, sequels have
often failed miserably in the past.

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:19.459
Fortunately for nervous Zombieland fans, Jesse
Eisenberg believes that his involvement in

00:02:19.459 --> 00:02:22.040
the movie should come as a sign that something
good is brewing.

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:23.460
He told the Toronto Sun,

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:26.490
"We would never have made another one if we
didn't think it was going to be great.

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:30.540
They wrote a ton of scripts for this movie,
and we went through a lot of different ideas.

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:33.180
Finally, we have something I think people
are going to love."

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:36.720
And Emma Stone discussed the importance of
the cast's camaraderie during an appearance

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:37.750
on The Tonight Show.

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:39.500
"Jesse Eisenberg and Woody Harrelson."

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:40.790
“Oh yeah, and Abigail Breslin.

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:41.790
Yeah, it was so much fun.

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:42.799
We played a lot of game.

00:02:42.799 --> 00:02:45.510
A lot of ping pong, a lot of pool…”

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:47.050
"A lot of board games."

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:51.160
The returning filmmaking talent also extends
behind the camera for Zombieland 2.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:55.560
Ruben Fleischer is coming hot off the heels
of helming Venom as he settles into the director's

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:56.520
chair for Double Tap.

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:00.650
Plus, original writers Paul Wernick and Rhett
Reese are also coming back.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:03.939
They too have been pretty busy in the last
few years, as they're the minds behind the

00:03:03.939 --> 00:03:05.230
Deadpool franchise.

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:09.150
While nothing is confirmed, the gap in time
is expected to play a large part in Wernick

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:10.260
and Reese's story.

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:13.720
And Fleischer wants everyone to know that
the Zombieland creative team waited so long

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:17.110
for a sequel because they wanted to ensure
that they had a good idea.

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:18.730
As he told Latino Review Media,

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:23.170
"I'm proud to say I think our script is really
great, in that the movie will be as good as

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:25.600
the original if not better, and that's why
we're all back."

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:30.280
To tease fans, the Zombieland marketing team
took advantage of the "ten-year challenge"

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:34.360
meme that went viral recently to announce
the film's official title and show the cast

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:35.760
together again for the first time.

00:03:36.269 --> 00:03:40.820
In the image shared on the official Zombieland
Twitter account in January 2019, Harrelson,

00:03:40.829 --> 00:03:45.459
Eisenberg, Stone, and Breslin recreated their
poses from the first film's poster.

00:03:45.459 --> 00:03:49.120
This time around, obviously, they're all ten
years older, even if a few of them don't look

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:49.640
it.

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:53.580
Unsurprisingly, Breslin looks the most different
of the bunch, as the 23-year-old actress was

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:55.760
only 13 when the original hit theaters.

00:03:56.180 --> 00:04:00.519
But we imagine that most of the crew has their
same old attitudes, even without the ten-year

00:04:00.519 --> 00:04:03.180
challenge reminding us how much things stay
the same.

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:07.180
Then on July 25, 2019, the first Double Tap
trailer arrived online.

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:11.800
The clip suggests that this unlikely unit
has settled into a comfortable life as a family.

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:15.800
They're even making strides toward normalcy,
as evidenced by a bit of a Christmas celebration.

00:04:16.180 --> 00:04:20.500
Alas, things are thrown out of whack when
the zombie survivors must adapt to the newcomers

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:21.020
among the living.

